[00:12.24]1. Stay awake, stand firm, grow mighty,
[00:12.24]Be determined to endure.
[00:15.20]Carry on with manly courage,
[00:30.14]For the victory is sure.
[00:30.14]We obey Christ Jesus’ clear command;
[00:30.14]Under him we firmly take our stand.
[00:30.14](Chorus)
[00:30.86]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[00:39.70]Carry on right to the end!
[00:44.30]2. Stay awake, and keep your senses,
[00:45.34]Always ready to obey.
[00:45.64]Stay alert to Christ’s direction
[00:57.54]Through his faithful slave today.
[00:57.58]Heed the counsel of the older men,
[00:57.58]Who protect his sheep and truth defend.
[00:57.70](Chorus)
[00:58.16]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[01:02.16]Carry on right to the end!
[01:52.20]3. Stay awake, remain united
[02:09.06]As the good news we defend.
[02:13.48]Though our enemies will fight it,
[02:17.54]We will preach until the end.
[02:22.04]Join the shout of praise throughout the land.
[02:26.32]Look! Jehovah’s day is soon at hand!
[02:31.52](Chorus)
[02:32.00]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[02:36.74]Carry on right to the end!
